    "explanation": "account-svc v1.5.0 rolled out shortly before onset (lines 89, 95). Right after, account-svc started throwing a TypeError in the new formatter code, tagged with v1.5.0 (lines 103, 114, 121). Only requests that hit that path fail, so most traffic still succeeds and the edge-proxy 500s are partial (lines 104, 128, 152, 165). It looks like bad input data, but the field is missing for any user without 'currency' — a code regression. Roll back to v1.4.9.",
